  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n#8699 changed a bunch of drafts.csswg.org links into w3c.github.io, because the former server was frequently down.\r\n\r\nThis was later addressed, now drafts.csswg.org serves specs using Github pages.\r\n\r\nw3c.github.io is not the official domain, so there is some JS that redirects users into drafts.csswg.org.\r\n\r\nThis is not much convenient, HTML should point to the official drafts.csswg.org directly.\r\n",
